{
    "title": "NBC 4 New York: News & Weather",
    "description": "The NBC 4 New York news and weather app connects you with local news, local weather and a free, 24/7 streaming news channel. Free to download and to use, the app delivers NYC breaking news alerts and weather alerts for your location that can be customized and easily managed in the app settings. \r\n\r\nThe app gives you access to New York local news from the award-winning NBC 4 New York news team, covering the issues and concerns most important to Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Staten Island, Long Island, New Jersey and Connecticut residents. The Storm Team 4 weather team delivers accurate local forecasts that keep app users safe and informed while on the go. Access a powerful weather radar and customize the weather screen based on your preferences. \r\n\r\nThe NBC 4 New York local app helps you stay informed with the following features:\r\n\r\nNEW YORK & TRI-STATE AREA WEATHER \r\n+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange \r\n+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts \r\n+ Live StormTracker 4 weather radar with exclusive features and data\r\n+ 10-day forecasts for your New York region \r\n+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph\r\n+ NYC local weather maps and radar  \r\n+ NYC local weather forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions \r\n+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app\r\n+ Weather closings for NYC and tri-state area schools\r\n+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists\r\n\r\nNEW YORK NEWS ALERTS \r\n+ Alerts for NY local news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings\r\n+ Top news of the day, covering breaking news, politics, weather and urgent product recalls \r\n+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order\r\n+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent NYC stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in NY local news and pop culture \r\n\r\nNBC NEW YORK NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL\r\n+ Free 24/7 NBC NY news streaming channel\r\n+ Live NBC 4 New York newscasts \r\n+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in NYC\r\n+ Entertainment and lifestyle videos from Access, Open House, New York Live, In the Wings and George to the Rescue\r\n+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed \r\n\r\nNBC NEW YORK I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS & MORE\r\n+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning NYC journalists\r\n+ Consumer reports from \u201cBetter Get Baquero\u201d\r\n+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks\r\n+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC\r\n+ Entertainment and celebrity news from E! Online and Access \r\n+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show\r\n\r\n\r\nNBC 4 New York is the flagship station of the NBCUniversal Local division of NBCUniversal, serving the New York tri-state area for more than 75 years. The team of journalists includes the NBC 4 I-Team, New York\u2019s largest televised investigative reporting unit, Better Get Baquero, which has recovered more than $9 million for tri-State consumers and Storm Team 4, certified by WeatheRate for delivering the tri-state\u2019s most accurate local weather forecast using cutting-edge technology such as Storm Tracker 4, a high-frequency S-Band dual polarization fixed Doppler weather radar. \r\n\r\nThe NBC 4 New York news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&intake=NBC_New_York/ \r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_New_York",
    "descriptionHTML": "The NBC 4 New York news and weather app connects you with local news, local weather and a free, 24/7 streaming news channel. Free to download and to use, the app delivers NYC breaking news alerts and weather alerts for your location that can be customized and easily managed in the app settings. <br><br>The app gives you access to New York local news from the award-winning NBC 4 New York news team, covering the issues and concerns most important to Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Staten Island, Long Island, New Jersey and Connecticut residents. The Storm Team 4 weather team delivers accurate local forecasts that keep app users safe and informed while on the go. Access a powerful weather radar and customize the weather screen based on your preferences. <br><br>The NBC 4 New York local app helps you stay informed with the following features:<br><br>NEW YORK &amp; TRI-STATE AREA WEATHER <br>+ Customizable weather home screen with weather modules you can rearrange <br>+ Upgraded location hub to add new locations and set up weather alerts <br>+ Live StormTracker 4 weather radar with exclusive features and data<br>+ 10-day forecasts for your New York region <br>+ Hourly forecasts featuring a customizable graph<br>+ NYC local weather maps and radar  <br>+ NYC local weather forecast data that includes UV index, air quality and other live weather conditions <br>+ Weather alerts for every location you save in the app<br>+ Weather closings for NYC and tri-state area schools<br>+ Weather news videos from your local meteorologists<br><br>NEW YORK NEWS ALERTS <br>+ Alerts for NY local news, national headlines and world news that can be personalized and managed in the app settings<br>+ Top news of the day, covering breaking news, politics, weather and urgent product recalls <br>+ Latest news feed that shows all articles and videos published in reverse chronological order<br>+ Alerts center that shows you the most urgent NYC stories of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications<br>+Trending section where you can discover daily, buzz-worthy topics in NY local news and pop culture <br><br>NBC NEW YORK NEWS 24/7 STREAMING CHANNEL<br>+ Free 24/7 NBC NY news streaming channel<br>+ Live NBC 4 New York newscasts <br>+ Breaking news live coverage of news briefings and other urgent news events in NYC<br>+ Entertainment and lifestyle videos from Access, Open House, New York Live, In the Wings and George to the Rescue<br>+ Dedicated video page with the latest video feed <br><br>NBC NEW YORK I-TEAM INVESTIGATIONS &amp; MORE<br>+ Investigative stories from local and award-winning NYC journalists<br>+ Consumer reports from \u201cBetter Get Baquero\u201d<br>+ Sports news from NBC Sports Regional Sports Networks<br>+ Business news, finance news and stock market news from CNBC<br>+ Entertainment and celebrity news from E! Online and Access <br>+ Lifestyle and entertainment news from NBC TODAY show<br><br><br>NBC 4 New York is the flagship station of the NBCUniversal Local division of NBCUniversal, serving the New York tri-state area for more than 75 years. The team of journalists includes the NBC 4 I-Team, New York\u2019s largest televised investigative reporting unit, Better Get Baquero, which has recovered more than $9 million for tri-State consumers and Storm Team 4, certified by WeatheRate for delivering the tri-state\u2019s most accurate local weather forecast using cutting-edge technology such as Storm Tracker 4, a high-frequency S-Band dual polarization fixed Doppler weather radar. <br><br>The NBC 4 New York news and weather app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.<br><br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?brandA=Owned_Stations&amp;intake=NBC_New_York/ <br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_New_York",
